{"text": "您好，这里是客服部，首先对本次订单延误深表歉意。", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "此次我方疏忽造成发货迟延，恳请您见谅。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "经查，货物目前滞留在海关，预计后天可以放行，敬请谅解。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "customs"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请问您希望最迟哪一天收到货物呢？", "frames": [{"act": "ask_deadline", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "恳请您提供一下订单编号，我们好立即为您查询。", "frames": [{"act": "ask_order", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我方将于今天重新安排发货，并预计周四送达贵处。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "today"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "thursday"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "关于折扣一事，公司内部规定不允许，实在难以应允。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "如果您现在确认订单，我们可以为您打九折。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 10}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "如果货物能早一点到就好了，真的很遗憾。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["hypothetical"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您说我们根本没有发货，这个我们再核实一下。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": ""}
{"text": "本次延误并非我方责任，是快递公司在中转站积压所致。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}], "tags": ["trap"], "note": ""}
{"text": "为表示歉意，我们将赠送您一张五十元的优惠券。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "运费由我们承担，另外安排空运为您加急处理。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "实在抱歉，加急服务我们这边恐怕无法提供。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "好的，就按您说的办，我们尽快处理。", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "非常感谢您的耐心等待与理解，期待今后继续合作。", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "今天天气很热，您那边怎么样？", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["offtopic"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不是不想给您退款，而是财务部门还在审核当中。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "other"}], "tags": ["trap"], "note": ""}
{"text": "恳请您再宽限我们两三天，货一定在三天内送到。", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "3_days"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "对不起对不起，是我们没有做好，给您添麻烦了。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["casual"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这批货因为工厂那边生产线出了故障，所以才耽误了。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "factory"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请您放心，我们一定会负责到底的。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["reassure"], "note": ""}
{"text": "要不要我们给您换一家快递呢？", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们将改走空运，优先为您发出，预计明天抵达。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "嗯，那个，就是说，我们这边会给您补发一份。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["filler"], "note": ""}
{"text": "本公司没有补偿的相关规定，还望您体谅。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "因台风影响，航班全部停飞，所以货物晚到了。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "weather"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您讲得对，货物确实迟到了，这是我们的失职。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "贵方的订单号码是多少呢？麻烦告诉我一下。", "frames": [{"act": "ask_order", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不会为您提供任何折扣，请见谅。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "-"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请问您大概几号需要这批货呢？", "frames": [{"act": "ask_deadline", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "好的没问题，那我们星期五之前送到您手上。", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "friday"}], "tags": ["casual"], "note": ""}
{"text": "昨天我们公司开了一整天的会，所以没来得及回复您。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["offtopic"], "note": ""}
{"text": "九五折作为赔礼，请您收下，同时深表歉意。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 5}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "全额退还运费，再送您一份小礼物，以表歉意。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "如果没有下雨的话，货早就到了。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["hypothetical"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您好您好，让您久等了，真的非常不好意思。", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["casual"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们今天下午就把包裹重新寄出，明天中午前一定到。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "today"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这不是我们的错，是海关扣了货，我们也很无奈。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "customs"}], "tags": ["trap"], "note": ""}
{"text": "客服说今天会到？那是前线同事的说法，实际情况请以我这边为准。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": ""}
{"text": "愿意的话，我们可以给您百分之二十的优惠，您觉得如何？", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "只要您同意，明天就给您发货。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "谢谢您，真的很感谢。", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们马上给您补发，同时安排优先配送。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "抱歉，现在没办法保证明天一定能到。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "-", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "此番给您带来诸多不便，谨致以最诚挚的歉意。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "恭请您确认一下收货地址是否有误。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "货在仓库里压了好几天，是我们工作疏漏。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不会推卸责任，一定会处理到底。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["trap"], "note": ""}
{"text": "并不是我们不想早点发货，而是原料迟迟没有到齐。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "factory"}], "tags": ["trap"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您说收到的是错的商品，我们马上核对。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": ""}
{"text": "关于您提出的退款要求，我们已向上级申请，退款金额会在三个工作日内到账。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "恕我直言，本次延误与我司无关。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "能否请您告知方便收货的日期？", "frames": [{"act": "ask_deadline", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "敬请告知运单号，以便我们向物流公司核实。", "frames": [{"act": "ask_order", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "好的，明白了，我们会按照您的要求办理。", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "那个，这个，我们周三肯定发出去，周五到。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "wednesday"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "friday"}], "tags": ["filler"], "note": ""}
{"text": "如果您同意换成顺丰，我们可以优先安排。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "今天午饭吃了拉面，味道还不错。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["offtopic"], "note": ""}
{"text": "哎呀，这个快递啊，真是……唉。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["emotion"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们愿意承担全部的赔偿责任。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "恐怕折扣方面，我们实在爱莫能助。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "抱歉让您久等，货物已于昨天交由顺丰，预计明天送达。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "要是早点告诉我们您着急，就不会这样了。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["hypothetical"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请您稍候片刻，我立刻为您确认。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "本次迟延，系由当地港口罢工引起，并非我方所能控制。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您好，我是韩国总部的客服，李某。", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "恳请您宽限几日，我们必将尽快安排。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "给您打八折，您看这样可以吗？", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们给您八折，请务必接受我们的诚意。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 20}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "抱歉，我们无法接受退货，这是公司规定。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "refuse", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "货物将于大后天抵达。", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "friday"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
