{"text": "您提到的“三天内必须到”，我们恐怕办不到。", "frames": [{"act": "refuse", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": ""}
{"text": "蒙您多次催促，实在惭愧，我们这就加急处理。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "加急费用由我方负担，请您不必担心。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "非常感谢您的指正，我们会引以为戒。", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "祝您生意兴隆，今后也请多多关照。", "frames": [{"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "那就拜托您了，再见。", "frames": [{"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "商品没有问题，只是路上耽搁了。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}], "tags": ["casual"], "note": ""}
