{"text": "我们这边没有折扣这一说，真的不好意思。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "-"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "麻烦您发一下订单截图给我。", "frames": [{"act": "ask_order", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["casual"], "note": ""}
