{"text": "不是我们不愿意赔偿，而是需要走公司流程。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "other"}], "tags": ["trap"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您讲的完全正确，是我们延误了，责任在我们。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不是不发货，是没有库存了。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "stock"}], "tags": ["trap"], "note": ""}
{"text": "若您愿意再等一天，我们送您一张免运费券。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "如果您肯收下赔偿，我们这就打款。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您说已经等了一个星期，我们这边也在查。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们明天上午一定补发，后天中午送到。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "dayafter"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "货在海关查验，一旦放行，我们立即空运给您。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "customs"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请您千万不要着急，我们会想办法。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["reassure"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这不是我们造成的，而是天气原因，台风太大了。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "weather"}], "tags": ["trap"], "note": ""}
