{"text": "请您放心，周六之前绝对送到。", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "saturday"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请问您还需要我们提供什么帮助吗？", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "若是方便的话，可否告知贵公司的收货截止时间？", "frames": [{"act": "ask_deadline", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "抱歉，这批货我们没法优先，其他客户也在等。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "十分钟之内我会再联系您，请稍等。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们将尽快安排空运，费用我们出，您不用再付一分钱。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "那份折扣我们可以保留，待您下次下单时使用。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "谢谢您的体谅，我们一定改进。", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "真的是非常对不起，让您白跑了一趟，还请多多海涵。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不好意思啊，那个快递，今天，呃，没送出去。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["filler"], "note": ""}
{"text": "今后我们一定改进，请您放心。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["reassure"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们拒绝承担这笔额外费用。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请恕我们无法满足您的要求，实在遗憾。", "frames": [{"act": "refuse", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "货品在途中受损，所以我们重新为您生产，三天后发出。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "3_days"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "星期三我们就把新的货寄给您，到时候请注意查收。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "wednesday"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "若您还有疑问，请随时联系我们，再见。", "frames": [{"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "打扰您了，祝您愉快，再会。", "frames": [{"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您好，这里是售后，您的包裹我们已经在跟进了。", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "对此我们没有任何借口，完全是我们的过失。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "合同里写明不可抗力除外，所以这次与我们无关。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这次港口大雾封港，所有货都压住了。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "weather"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们送您九五折和免运费，作为赔罪。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 5}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "补偿的话，我们愿意提供一次免费的升级配送。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "给您八五折，已经是极限了，请理解。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 15}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "打折是不可能的，我们不接受议价。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "对于您的投诉，我们已记录在案，将严肃处理。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请告诉我您的订单编号后四位即可。", "frames": [{"act": "ask_order", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["casual"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您到底要在哪一天之前收到呢？", "frames": [{"act": "ask_deadline", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "如果您那边方便，我们明天傍晚前送到。", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "没问题，您说的我们都照办。", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "抱歉，因为系统故障，您的订单昨天才被录入。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "other"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您说客服答应过免运费，但是我们这里没有这样的记录。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": ""}
{"text": "近日物价波动较大，贵国的行情如何？", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["offtopic"], "note": ""}
{"text": "此次事件，深感愧疚，今后定当严加管理。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "敬请原谅，我们的疏漏已经修正。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "货会在下周一抵达，这次没问题。", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "monday"}], "tags": ["short"], "note": ""}
{"text": "昨天我家猫生病了，一整晚没睡。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["offtopic"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我方将安排加急件，今日内发出，周四必达。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "today"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "thursday"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "退款不行，但可以换货。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不打算再补发，因为库存已经清空。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "-"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "stock"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "麻烦您确认一下，是不是已经签收了？", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["question"], "note": ""}
{"text": "嗯，我们会跟进的，就是，不好意思您再等一下。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["filler"], "note": ""}
{"text": "愿您事业顺利，期待下次合作。", "frames": [{"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您指出的问题完全属实，我们感到十分惭愧，诚挚致歉。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "货被卡在海关两天了，这个我们也没办法，抱歉。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "customs"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["fluent"], "note": ""}
{"text": "十分感激您的宽容，我们将不负所托。", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您说要求赔偿，这方面我们会再请示上级。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["quote"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不会让您白等，这次一定准时，周三到。", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "wednesday"}], "tags": ["formal"], "note": ""}
{"text": "对不起，我们不能保证周五能到，只能说尽力。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "-", "when": "friday"}], "tags": ["negation"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请您发给我快递单号，我再去催一下。", "frames": [{"act": "ask_order", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["casual"], "note": ""}
